# Tests of the `regions` module; generated from tools/regions.dsl by tools/build.py. They run under
# `refined test`, where machine and system targets work in the JIT's own process.

regionTest is test
regionTest purpose "A region hands out zeroed, aligned, separate blocks, counts what it was asked for, and gives its chunks back"
regionTest verifies newRegion startsEmpty
regionTest verifies allocate handsOutZeroed
regionTest verifies remaining countsAsked
regionTest verifies release reusesChunks
regionTest typeParameter none
regionTest input none
regionTest output none
regionTest outputOwnedBy none
regionTest raises none
regionTest effect use machine.memory
regionTest effect use system.calls
regionTest uses memoryAccess
regionTest uses systemCalls
regionTest memoryHeap false
regionTest async false
regionTest maxRecursion none
regionTest label begin loopKind none
regionTest label begin within none
regionTest let label String "region `scratch` of `regionTest`" immutable
regionTest let capacity Int64 100000 immutable
regionTest let three Int64 3 immutable
regionTest let five Int64 5 immutable
regionTest let left99992 Int64 99992 immutable
regionTest let sixteen Int64 16 immutable
regionTest let zero Int64 0 immutable
regionTest let sevenByte Byte 7 immutable
regionTest let ninetyThousand Int64 90000 immutable
regionTest let forty Int64 40 immutable
regionTest let two Int64 2 immutable
regionTest let one Int64 1 immutable
